  "response_with_ans": "Let\n\\begin{align*}\nS_1 &= a + b + c + d + e + f, \\\\\nS_2 &= a + 2b + 3c + 4d + 2e + 2f, \\\\\nS_3 &= a + 3b + 6c + 9d + 4e + 6f, \\\\\nS_4 &= a + 4b + 10c + 16d + 8e + 24f, \\\\\nS_5 &= a + 5b + 15c + 25d + 16e + 120f, \\\\\nS_6 &= a + 6b + 21c + 36d + 32e + 720f.\n\\end{align*}Then\n\\begin{align*}\nS_2 - S_1 &= b + 2c + 3d + e + f, \\\\\nS_3 - S_2 &= b + 3c + 5d + 2e + 4f, \\\\\nS_4 - S_3 &= b + 4c + 7d + 4e + 18f, \\\\\nS_5 - S_4 &= b + 5c + 9d + 8e + 96f, \\\\\nS_6 - S_5 &= b + 6c + 11d + 16e + 600f.\n\\end{align*}Let\n\\begin{align*}\nT_1 &= b + 2c + 3d + e + f, \\\\\nT_2 &= b + 3c + 5d + 2e + 4f, \\\\\nT_3 &= b + 4c + 7d + 4e + 18f, \\\\\nT_4 &= b + 5c + 9d + 8e + 96f, \\\\\nT_5 &= b + 6c + 11d + 16e + 600f.\n\\end{align*}Then\n\\begin{align*}\nT_2 - T_1 &= c + 2d + e + 3f, \\\\\nT_3 - T_2 &= c + 2d + 2e + 14f, \\\\\nT_4 - T_3 &= c + 2d + 4e + 78f, \\\\\nT_5 - T_4 &= c + 2d + 8e + 504f.\n\\end{align*}Let\n\\begin{align*}\nU_1 &= c + 2d + e + 3f, \\\\\nU_2 &= c + 2d + 2e + 14f, \\\\\nU_3 &= c + 2d + 4e + 78f, \\\\\nU_4 &= c + 2d + 8e + 504f.\n\\end{align*}Then\n\\begin{align*}\nU_2 - U_1 &= e + 11f, \\\\\nU_3 - U_2 &= 2e + 64f, \\\\\nU_4 - U_3 &= 4e + 426f.\n\\end{align*}Let\n\\begin{align*}\nV_1 &= e + 11f, \\\\\nV_2 &= 2e + 64f, \\\\\nV_3 &= 4e + 426f.\n\\end{align*}Then\n\\begin{align*}\nV_2 - 2V_1 &= 42f, \\\\\nV_3 - 2V_2 &= 302f.\n\\end{align*}Hence, $f = \\frac{V_2 - 2V_1}{42} = \\frac{V_3 - 2V_2}{302}.$  Substituting, we find $e = \\frac{23V_1 - V_2}{21},$ $c = U_1 - 2d - \\frac{23V_1 - V_2}{21} - 3 \\cdot \\frac{V_2 - 2V_1}{42} = U_1 - 2d - \\frac{25V_1 - 5V_2}{42},$ $b = T_1 - 2c - 3d - \\frac{23V_1 - V_2}{21} - \\frac{V_2 - 2V_1}{42} = T_1 - 2c - 3d - \\frac{47V_1 - 9V_2}{42},$ and $a = S_1 - b - c - d - \\frac{23V_1 - V_2}{21} - \\frac{V_2 - 2V_1}{42} = S_1 - b - c - d - \\frac{47V_1 - 9V_2}{42}.$\n\nSince $S_1 = S_2 = S_3 = S_4 = 0$ and $S_5 = 42,$ $T_1 = T_2 = T_3 = T_4 = 0$ and $T_5 = 42.$  Hence, $U_1 = U_2 = U_3 = 0$ and $U_4 = 42,$ so $V_1 = V_2 = 0$ and $V_3 = 42.$  Then $f = 1,$ $e = 0,$ $c = -2d,$ $b = -3d,$ and $a = -d.$  Therefore,\n\\[a + 6b + 21c + 36d + 32e + 720f = -d - 18d - 42d + 36d + 720 = \\boxed{720}.\\]",
